Changes of the Raku package "JavaScript::Google::Charts"

0.1.1 2026-10-25
    - Bug fix of column names argument passing for scatter plots.

0.1.0 2026-10-11
    - Controls and dashboards support.
    - Implemented Calendar Chart.
    - Special handling of Raku Nil to JSON null in order to able to plot wide form data (with Nils).